<document xmlns="http://cnx.rice.edu/cnxml" xmlns:m="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
  <title>Lesson Summary</title>
  <metadata xmlns:md="http://cnx.rice.edu/mdml">
    <md:content-id>m02377</md:content-id>
    <md:title>Lesson Summary</md:title>
    <md:uuid>a263dbb2-c2a3-4d3e-aa02-78af2e4b0f7d</md:uuid>
  </metadata>
  <content>
    <section id="sect-00001">
      <para id="para-00001">In this lesson, you learned how to:</para>
      <list id="list-00001">
        <item>Solve by completing the square when given a quadratic equation in which the coefficient of the squared term is 1.</item>
      </list>
      <para id="para-00002">Here are the <emphasis>activities</emphasis> that helped you reach those goals:</para>
      <list id="list-00002">
        <item>9.3.1: Solving Equations with Fractions <list id="list-00003">
            <item>In this activity, you mentally solved equations with fractions and exponents.</item>
          </list></item>
        <item>9.3.2: Using Completing the Square to Solve Equations <list id="list-00004">
            <item>In this activity, you solved quadratic equations involving rational numbers including decimals and fractions.</item>
            <item>9.3.2: Self Check</item>
            <item>9.3.2: Additional Resources</item>
          </list></item>
        <item>9.3.3: Solve by Completing the Square <list id="list-00005">
            <item>In this activity, you examined the steps to solving quadratic equations by completing the square and identified the step where an error occurred.</item>
            <item>9.3.3: Self Check</item>
            <item>9.3.3: Additional Resources</item>
          </list></item>
        <item>9.3.4: Completing the Square with Fractions <list id="list-00006">
            <item>In this activity, you showed how to get the given zeros of the quadratic by completing the square.</item>
          </list></item>
      </list>
      <para id="para-00003">After these activities, you completed the following <emphasis>practice</emphasis>:</para>
      <list id="list-00007">
        <item>9.3.5: Practice</item>
      </list>
      <section class="checking-in" id="sect-00002" data-platform-hidden="assignable">
        <title>Checking In</title>
        <exercise id="_29b3aac8-c795-45dc-9226-667245e97861" class="multiple-choice">
          <problem id="prob-00001">
            <para id="para-00004">On a scale of 1 to 5, how confident do you feel about the learning goals of this lesson?</para>
          </problem>
          <solution id="sol-00001">
            <para id="para-00005">Nice reflection! You learn more when you take the time to reflect on your thinking.</para>
          </solution>
        </exercise>
      </section>
    </section>
  </content>
</document>